    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/c83df7033ea7a956c91b3e912b9c06bb.poster.avif?t=1730035075\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/c83df7033ea7a956c91b3e912b9c06bb.webm?t=1730035075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/c83df7033ea7a956c91b3e912b9c06bb.mp4?t=1730035075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Strange things are happening into the &quot;Hippo&quot; Station. The crew is being evacuated in a hurry. You will have to understand what happened and do your best to fix the situation.  The artificial intelligence controlling the station behaves suspiciously, the mechanized personnel look extremely unfriendly, and mysterious silhouettes flicker in the corridors.<br><br>The situation is getting worse by the minute.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/461a8c17bd6352cc58a7964408877da4.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities! Hack, lock, break your enemies. Shoot from the various weapons, fight in hand-to-hand combat or hide. Make your way into the depths of the &quot;Hippo&quot; station by any means necessary<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/1bf6b9e2bdd03af1ed539874af5a9d54.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Limited ammunition, shortage of the first aid kits and other items, a rare upgrades, a tough enemies - only the strongest will be able to cope with the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/1570a7d241d3f2fc77d6bc3ad7483535.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dynamic music and the spatial audio system designed to send chills down the spine of even the bravest<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/bcf2b56b6bb4c95e218ee1be964ecc22.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NanoCatastrophe encourages the exploration of paths and solutions. Some discoveries will be pleasant and rewarding, while others will bring a suffering.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/c83df7033ea7a956c91b3e912b9c06bb.poster.avif?t=1730035075\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/c83df7033ea7a956c91b3e912b9c06bb.webm?t=1730035075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/c83df7033ea7a956c91b3e912b9c06bb.mp4?t=1730035075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Strange things are happening into the &quot;Hippo&quot; Station. The crew is being evacuated in a hurry. You will have to understand what happened and do your best to fix the situation.  The artificial intelligence controlling the station behaves suspiciously, the mechanized personnel look extremely unfriendly, and mysterious silhouettes flicker in the corridors.<br><br>The situation is getting worse by the minute.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/461a8c17bd6352cc58a7964408877da4.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities! Hack, lock, break your enemies. Shoot from the various weapons, fight in hand-to-hand combat or hide. Make your way into the depths of the &quot;Hippo&quot; station by any means necessary<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/1bf6b9e2bdd03af1ed539874af5a9d54.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Limited ammunition, shortage of the first aid kits and other items, a rare upgrades, a tough enemies - only the strongest will be able to cope with the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/1570a7d241d3f2fc77d6bc3ad7483535.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dynamic music and the spatial audio system designed to send chills down the spine of even the bravest<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247510/extras/bcf2b56b6bb4c95e218ee1be964ecc22.avif?t=1730035075\" width=588 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NanoCatastrophe encourages the exploration of paths and solutions. Some discoveries will be pleasant and rewarding, while others will bring a suffering.</p>",
